    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.poster.avif?t=1725042252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.webm?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.mp4?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure with Oxygen Cocktail - an open-world visual novel game that seamlessly blends elements of adventure and storytelling. You will take on the role of a child who spends their summer in a quaint village with their parents, discovering the hidden secrets that lie within.<br><br>As you journey through the village, you'll encounter various fascinating characters with unique stories and personalities. You'll help solve problems, make new friends, and unravel the mysteries of the surrounding environment.<br><br>The world of Oxygen Cocktail is brought to life through stunning isometric pixel-art visuals combined with other styles to create a truly unique aesthetic. The game boasts a captivating soundtrack and storyline that will keep you hooked from start to finish.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of rural areas, relive childhood memories, and experience the magic of Oxygen Cocktail. The game promises a one-of-a-kind gaming experience that you won't soon forget.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.poster.avif?t=1725042252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.webm?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.mp4?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open-world adventure: Explore a charming rural village and its surrounding environment<br></li><li>Unique aesthetic: Experience a seamless blend of isometric pixel art and other styles, creating a truly unique visual experience<br></li><li>Engaging storytelling: Uncover secrets and solve puzzles as you interact with a cast of fascinating characters<br></li><li>Immersive soundtrack: Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that enhances the game's overall atmosphere</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.poster.avif?t=1725042252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.webm?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/25337aa3806c770f15f84ec5acc59118.mp4?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure with Oxygen Cocktail - an open-world visual novel game that seamlessly blends elements of adventure and storytelling. You will take on the role of a child who spends their summer in a quaint village with their parents, discovering the hidden secrets that lie within.<br><br>As you journey through the village, you'll encounter various fascinating characters with unique stories and personalities. You'll help solve problems, make new friends, and unravel the mysteries of the surrounding environment.<br><br>The world of Oxygen Cocktail is brought to life through stunning isometric pixel-art visuals combined with other styles to create a truly unique aesthetic. The game boasts a captivating soundtrack and storyline that will keep you hooked from start to finish.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of rural areas, relive childhood memories, and experience the magic of Oxygen Cocktail. The game promises a one-of-a-kind gaming experience that you won't soon forget.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.poster.avif?t=1725042252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.webm?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352410/extras/0bfaa9940f17248b91c8583934dcaa9f.mp4?t=1725042252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open-world adventure: Explore a charming rural village and its surrounding environment<br></li><li>Unique aesthetic: Experience a seamless blend of isometric pixel art and other styles, creating a truly unique visual experience<br></li><li>Engaging storytelling: Uncover secrets and solve puzzles as you interact with a cast of fascinating characters<br></li><li>Immersive soundtrack: Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that enhances the game's overall atmosphere</li></ul><br>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a captivating adventure in Oxygen Cocktail, an open-world visual novel game. Solve puzzles, make friends, and uncover secrets in a charming rural village. Immerse yourself in a unique aesthetic that blends isometric pixel art and other styles.",
